          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.6,
          "end": 92.85,
          "en": "even though there also are paid plans,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 92.85,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "which give you access to more advanced features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "and that everyone can get started with that editor.",
